Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:10.26,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.26,0:00:12.53,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.83,0:01:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.19,0:02:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there! You approaching\Nthis area, can you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.29,0:02:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a little troubled because I'm out of gas...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.48,0:02:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you take me to Ganymede?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dammit, why does everyone...?!\NWhy won't they stop?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This sea rat
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,used to be raised in\Nthe oceans of Ganymede.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.75,0:03:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,After the gates stabilized,\Nfood was no longer scarce.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, now the ones in the wild get\Neaten by those who have a fancy for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So, is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.18,0:03:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's totally disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.27,0:03:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just expensive because\Nit's a Ganymede specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.98,0:03:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's no good.\NI'll have the lobster miso stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.38,0:03:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't look good, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I thought I'd go for\Nsomething expensive while I'm at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.81,0:03:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean, because we'll\Nsoon have some money?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.78,0:03:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that Gould was a spy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Mom, don't worry. We sunk his ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right. One vial nowadays\Ndoesn't mean much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's continue the deal as we initially planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But... who was in charge of\Nwatching the house then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.03,0:04:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you, Harrison?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, uh, Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where's my sea rat sauté?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, there, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt. It's Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.09,0:04:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then shall we go before we get breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.45,0:04:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, did you know\Nthat the Ganymede sea rat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,is a very intelligent and kind animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that? {10 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman... I think she was...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.76,0:04:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember ordering a circus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.55,0:05:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I've seen her somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We, the Space Warriors, work night{\i0}\N{\i1}and day to preserve the environment{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.11,0:05:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and protect endangered species{\i0}\N{\i1}all over the universe.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.95,0:05:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember now!\NThat lady's worth 25 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end, Mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.01,0:05:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to see your mom in pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:05:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Morgan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.85,0:06:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's full of holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a problem. He was\Ngonna put food on our table.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's worth nothing compared to\Nthe 25 million that you're worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.40,0:06:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it. These guys are bounty hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.77,0:06:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of the home. I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. If you don't go now,\Nthe cops are gonna arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.57,0:06:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, sit tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Harrison, you'll get\Nplenty of punishment later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(612,941.333,781.333,1053.333)}Mom!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.87,0:06:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(612,941.333,780,1053.333)}Mom!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky you, Harrison. Your mom\Nwon't be back for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.29,0:06:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please... Take this to the ISSP...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:07:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But... don't open it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! {added this}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.47,0:07:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he want me to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Universal Environmental Protection Society? {linked to next line to lower CPS}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,More like environmental terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They're called the Space Warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.61,0:07:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They used to be a good group\Nworking on environmental
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.09,0:07:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,preservation and the protection\Nof endangered species.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But since their leader changed two years ago,\Ntheir focus drastically changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only a few members,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.21,0:07:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but now they're even worse than\Na lot of syndicates out there. {made this 9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They're especially keen on\Nprotecting the Ganymede sea rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's the leader of this terrorist\Ngroup: Twinkle Maria Murdock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't associate us with terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.39,0:07:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We are warriors of peace,\Nfighting for the law of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:07:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And where can we get\Nthe 25 million in reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.46,0:08:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ganymede government.\NBut we can't cash in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm checking on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The government canceled\Nthe reward yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're told not to open it,\Nthe more you want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing opened by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.93,0:08:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, as you requested,{\i0}\N{\i1}we have canceled the bounty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.81,0:08:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And we are debating about prohibiting{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:08:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the fishing of sea rats on Ganymede as well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.14,0:09:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where's Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As I said, we haven't gotten{\i0}\N{\i1}word of Twinkle's capture!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we can find out who captured them...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mom doesn't come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll set that plan into action immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}W-Wait! We're not going\Nagainst your wishes!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like it would ease my hunger...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, that terrorist act\Nwe saw isn't on the records, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.15,0:09:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I told you that you\Ncouldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you can just let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it... There's\Nsomething behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:10:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello there! You approaching{\i0}\N{\i1}this area, can you see me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm a little troubled because I'm out of gas...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, she's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you take me to Ganymede?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.43,0:10:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.93,0:10:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even getting a little propellant{\i0}\N{\i1}would be wonderful!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Can you hear me or what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,D'oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.34,0:10:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You spent all the money you\Ntook from us at the casino?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.57,0:10:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As they say, "money makes\Nthe world go round."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They also say,\N"thieves have no compassion."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it over there? {3 frames extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm contacting an old friend. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, there isn't even\Nanything worth keeping...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... I still don't know where that virus is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr. President...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We will continue to do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Chief!{\i0} {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.14,0:11:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The one who nabbed Twinkle...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.53,0:11:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You found them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And, that guy told you to\Ntake this to the ISSP?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. Doesn't that look\Nlike it's worth something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.20,0:11:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how about we call it even?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I never trust anything thieves say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all this about?! Hey, Bob! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.10,0:11:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing is really up.{\i0} {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bounty has been canceled.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.67,0:11:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're saying you should{\i0}\N{\i1}let her go immediately.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bob...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When we worked in the same department,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:12:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}a lot of the confiscated{\i0}\N{\i1}eye drops disappeared, you know?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.94,0:12:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do ya wanna say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you wanna work until retirement age,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}isn't it a better idea for{\i0}\N{\i1}you to go along with me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, all right. I get what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't break it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.93,0:12:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The guys are threatening{\i0}\N{\i1}under the mask of "negotiation."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're holding the 8 million{\i0}\N{\i1}residents of Ganymede hostage.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.15,0:12:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They basically kidnapped\Nthe leader in virus technology
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and created a virus to their liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.32,0:12:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The virus is called Monkey Business.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They say that humans and monkeys only{\i0}\N{\i1}have a 2% difference in DNA structure,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and apparently this virus{\i0}\N{\i1}acts on those two percent.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.41,0:12:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, that virus selectively acts only on humans.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.73,0:13:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost contact with the ISSP spy\Nthat infiltrated their group. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.96,0:13:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we had no other option.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're going to agree to their terms?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this was a big one\Nthat we caught, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's orders from up above!\NWe couldn't do anything about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.89,0:13:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're releasing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Us... or them...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.35,0:14:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of us deserves\Npunishment from heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, the time of judgment will arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.69,0:14:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... Soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.61,0:14:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The release procedure\Nhas been completed. {2 frames extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.29,0:14:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We will continue to monitor\Nher using our special agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.99,0:14:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the satellite?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be ready in about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.03,0:14:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the chemical\Ntech group as well. {added a line break to make reading quicker}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything until we\Nknow where the virus is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, a communication from Twinkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Long time no see, Minister.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.18,0:14:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}About that promise we made...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So... about the sea rats,\Nwe will keep a stable population
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,using limitations on hunting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Didn't I say {\i0}prohibition{\i1} of hunting?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:15:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, we will look at the\Ndemands in a positive light...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.35,0:15:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Looks like you need some{\i0}\N{\i1}punishment to understand.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.97,0:15:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! I don't want to\Nbecome a monkey! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Alpha 1-0-5 to headquarters.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The target has entered{\i0}\N{\i1}the wasteland area.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger. Continue pursuit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, they're too easygoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.08,0:16:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All that and no reward...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.81,0:16:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jet, can you hear me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Turn on channel 72 and watch it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.45,0:16:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're broadcasting from\Ntheir own satellite!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This isn't just about the sea rats.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Humans, with their culture,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.15,0:16:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}have escaped from the great system of nature{\i0} {10 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.73,0:16:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and are committing crimes{\i0}\N{\i1}that cannot be amended.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.22,0:16:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those that don't realize this{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}are what you could call{\i0}\N{\i1}"bugs" in the nature system.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.44,0:17:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship was a decoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they\Nbroadcasting from? {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's near here. They're...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,in hyperspace!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Monkey Business, our virus,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}takes such humans and{\i0}\N{\i1}returns them to nature.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.59,0:17:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Understand?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Au revoir.{\i0} {10 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good news, Jet!{\i0} {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Ganymede government has reestablished{\i0}\N{\i1}the ransom on Twinkle and company!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.04,0:17:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our chance! We're\Nthe only ones around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But just catching them won't do.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.81,0:17:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If the missile falls, there'll be{\i0}\N{\i1}nobody here that can pay the bounty!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.72,0:18:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's nothing to bitch about\Nif we get rid of the missile, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.32,0:18:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're at the exit to a gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.64,0:18:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.41,0:18:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the defense system?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.99,0:18:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,4 minutes and 30 seconds to impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.99,0:18:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The system won't make it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This is an emergency!\NGet the President!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.54,0:18:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.70,0:18:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It split?! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet! Get the last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! There aren't any\Nweapons over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I wait for the next shot to fully charge,\Nthat thing'll hit Ganymede!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh? Are you in trouble?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.01,0:19:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How about for 80% of the earnings?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.22,0:19:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay, bye! Have a nice day!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. 40%. No more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! I get the 60!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine... We got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, will she make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Multiple warheads?!\NThis ain't the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all of you, become apes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.72,0:20:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jet! The guys from the government{\i0}\N{\i1}are closing down the gate!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're going to enclose all of it{\i0}\N{\i1}in hyperspace, missile and all!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.43,0:20:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute, this isn't a joke! {added the hesitation}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.18,0:20:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.80,0:20:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:20:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Didn't you learn in high school?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.11,0:21:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Matter that gets enclosed{\i0}\N{\i1}in hyperspace can be seen{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but will never interact with\Nmatter in this realm again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.30,0:21:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! The gate's closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.25,0:21:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom, what can we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.11,0:21:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.27,0:21:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So... this and that and no reward.\NAll that work for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't look so down,\Nwe can make money next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.89,0:21:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll go take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.19,0:22:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time? Make money?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.68,0:22:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jet, what did she just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.76,0:22:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me! Just don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.33,0:22:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's off to shower without asking us...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.01,0:22:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are we gonna take all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.54,0:22:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me! Just don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll go tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.13,0:22:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Spike...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.42,0:22:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Should've seen that coming.
