Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.04,0:23:45.46,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}isn't such a bad life
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.04,0:23:45.46,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}isn't such a bad life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.46,0:23:54.16,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}ichido kiri de owaru nara
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.46,0:23:54.16,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}ichido kiri de owaru nara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.46,0:23:54.16,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.46,0:23:54.16,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.16,0:24:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The supposedly broken music\Nbox starts to move,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.07,0:24:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and a nostalgic tune fills the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.18,0:24:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I then happen to wake up\Nfrom the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.19,0:24:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no such thing as a music box, {10 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.62,0:24:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,yet, there is a small\Nmusic box nestled in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.91,0:24:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And I awake from the dream again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.65,0:24:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I was peeling an onion,\Nit's a dream no matter how far I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.86,0:24:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never return to reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.56,0:24:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a nightmare, this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.16,0:24:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Ballad for Fallen Angels.
